    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5704" root="جزع" body-key="j">
    
      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اجزع جِزْعَةً</span></b> , and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جُزْعَةً</span>, <i>He left,</i> or <i>caused to
remain, a remainder:</i> (O, K:) or <i>less than half.</i>
(TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اجزعهُ</span> <i>He caused him to be impatient:</i>
(S, K:) or <i>he caused him to want sufficient strength
to bear what befell him, and to be impatient.</i>
(Msb.)

